(2508284, 346501, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very moody - almost film noire.  Sensual, sexy shot without being too racy.  Well done!</td>', 'Very moody - almost film noire.  Sensual, sexy shot without being too racy.  Well done!', '2006-06-12 02:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
