(2508543, 345927, 60165, '<td valign="top">Shadow is nice but I am really impressed by the technique. Is this a jump into (sufficiently deep) water, or how is it done? If model dies from broken neck for every shot, I hope it didn''t take too many shots/models to get this one!<br/> <br/>Just for the idea I cannot give less than 9 ...</td>', 'Shadow is nice but I am really impressed by the technique. Is this a jump into (sufficiently deep) water, or how is it done? If model dies from broken neck for every shot, I hope it didn''t take too many shots/models to get this one! Just for the idea I cannot give less than 9 ...', '2006-06-12 05:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
