(2508762, 345726, 55838, '<td valign="top">Back to comment.  This is gorgeous - a beautiful image.  Very nice work.  In a silhouette competition I''d give this a 9.  Since to my eyes it''s a little more about silhouettes than shadows, it''s a 7 with a possible bump later.</td>', 'Back to comment.  This is gorgeous - a beautiful image.  Very nice work.  In a silhouette competition I''d give this a 9.  Since to my eyes it''s a little more about silhouettes than shadows, it''s a 7 with a possible bump later.', '2006-06-12 07:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2508766, 346302, 55838, '<td valign="top">Back to comment.  I love the idea and the execution on this...cool shadows, great backdrop.  The yellow tones really set this apart nicely.  Good job.</td>', 'Back to comment.  I love the idea and the execution on this...cool shadows, great backdrop.  The yellow tones really set this apart nicely.  Good job.', '2006-06-12 07:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2508768, 345842, 55838, '<td valign="top">Back to comment.  This is a cool shadow image.  The red is gorgeous and the shadows are fun and interesting.  Wonderful lighting on the background.</td>', 'Back to comment.  This is a cool shadow image.  The red is gorgeous and the shadows are fun and interesting.  Wonderful lighting on the background.', '2006-06-12 07:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2508770, 345891, 22689, '<td valign="top">First impression I had is the quality of your photo : the tones you chose and the focus.<br/>I like the composition too ; the subject and title fits very well , cats love the sun and heat and the pupils of their eyes have the skill to adapt themself to the amount of light.<br/>A very good idea very well executed !</td>', 'First impression I had is the quality of your photo : the tones you chose and the focus.I like the composition too ; the subject and title fits very well , cats love the sun and heat and the pupils of their eyes have the skill to adapt themself to the amount of light.A very good idea very well executed !', '2006-06-12 07:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2508772, 345387, 52549, '<td valign="top">Super, love everything about it.</td>', 'Super, love everything about it.', '2006-06-12 07:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
