(2509060, 345675, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great image, but I think it would fit the challenge better if it were cropped somewhat closer to the shadow. The road and truck in the foreground are real distractions, as is the red building on the right.</td>', 'Great image, but I think it would fit the challenge better if it were cropped somewhat closer to the shadow. The road and truck in the foreground are real distractions, as is the red building on the right.', '2006-06-12 11:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
