(2509090, 346264, 12733, '<td valign="top">Does that shadow make a face? It''s a great arrangement, and the fruits and veggies make a pleasing still life on their own.</td>', 'Does that shadow make a face? It''s a great arrangement, and the fruits and veggies make a pleasing still life on their own.', '2006-06-12 11:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
