(2509099, 346383, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice graphic sense.  The muted terra cotta, olive and golden colors work well together against the black of the stairs and shadow.</td>', 'Nice graphic sense.  The muted terra cotta, olive and golden colors work well together against the black of the stairs and shadow.', '2006-06-12 11:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2509102, 346343, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the use of negative space in the cutouts and the way they form shadows. I''m still scratching my head over how you got the center shadow, which bears no relation to the object casting it. I hope you''ll explain this when the competition closes.</td>', 'I like the use of negative space in the cutouts and the way they form shadows. I''m still scratching my head over how you got the center shadow, which bears no relation to the object casting it. I hope you''ll explain this when the competition closes.', '2006-06-12 11:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2509107, 346501, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but the shape behind the bonds doesn''t look like a bound person.</td>', 'Interesting concept, but the shape behind the bonds doesn''t look like a bound person.', '2006-06-12 11:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2509111, 345886, 12733, '<td valign="top">One of the prettier examples of the RGB shadow pix in the challenge.</td>', 'One of the prettier examples of the RGB shadow pix in the challenge.', '2006-06-12 11:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2509113, 346171, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really good.  Love the old Underwood typewriter. Or is it a Royal? Perfect title. I saw it and immediately thought of Guy Noir, the PI on Prairie Home Companion.<br/> <br/>Great post editing. Bumping up. This is the best of the challenge. 10</td>', 'Really good.  Love the old Underwood typewriter. Or is it a Royal? Perfect title. I saw it and immediately thought of Guy Noir, the PI on Prairie Home Companion. Great post editing. Bumping up. This is the best of the challenge. 10', '2006-06-12 11:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2509115, 346496, 12733, '<td valign="top">...and shadow basket. Nice composition.</td>', '...and shadow basket. Nice composition.', '2006-06-12 11:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2509119, 345955, 12733, '<td valign="top">The bright areas are what make this shot, the shadows are incidental at best and distracting at worst.</td>', 'The bright areas are what make this shot, the shadows are incidental at best and distracting at worst.', '2006-06-12 11:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
