(2509125, 346219, 12733, '<td valign="top">You picked a nice background for the shadow, one which really shows a different texture effect in the shadowed areas. I wish you''d cropped out your foot, the pure shadow would have been more effective.</td>', 'You picked a nice background for the shadow, one which really shows a different texture effect in the shadowed areas. I wish you''d cropped out your foot, the pure shadow would have been more effective.', '2006-06-12 11:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
