(2510030, 346059, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the idea you came up with for this shot since so many shadows are balck and you came up with a creative way to do something different.  I think I would have like to have seen some a different angle or composition then having the vase dead center of the photo. maybe have tried standing alittle closer and a step or two the right or left so the shadows appear longer and exaggerated against the wall. just some suggestions</td>', 'I like the idea you came up with for this shot since so many shadows are balck and you came up with a creative way to do something different.  I think I would have like to have seen some a different angle or composition then having the vase dead center of the photo. maybe have tried standing alittle closer and a step or two the right or left so the shadows appear longer and exaggerated against the wall. just some suggestions', '2006-06-12 17:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2510033, 346300, 7322, '<td valign="top">This seems to be more about the lightning and sillouhette than shadow. I don''t really see a sillouhetted object as being the same as cast shadows. I guess that is nitpicky but this just doesn''t work for me for this challenge.</td>', 'This seems to be more about the lightning and sillouhette than shadow. I don''t really see a sillouhetted object as being the same as cast shadows. I guess that is nitpicky but this just doesn''t work for me for this challenge.', '2006-06-12 17:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2510039, 346411, 7322, '<td valign="top">I think you needed to stop down your exposure a bit to get a more contrasty capture of the shadow. It doesn''t make much of an impact with this somewhat overexposed shot.</td>', 'I think you needed to stop down your exposure a bit to get a more contrasty capture of the shadow. It doesn''t make much of an impact with this somewhat overexposed shot.', '2006-06-12 17:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
