(2511735, 346153, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is a very pleasing example of geometry and light, which should also please the majority of voters one would imagine.  it feels quite arty, and i love the brightness of the white and the depth of the blue.  very nice, 8.</td>', 'this is a very pleasing example of geometry and light, which should also please the majority of voters one would imagine.  it feels quite arty, and i love the brightness of the white and the depth of the blue.  very nice, 8.', '2006-06-13 04:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2511742, 345955, 16004, '<td valign="top">i like the variety of colours, and also the picture gives a clear impression of what it would be like to touch the toad / frog, it conveying texture very well...  i personally might have tried cropping within the confines of edges of the glass container, as the background (or the fact that the picture isn''t quite level) is more of a distraction.  this picture is also let down slightly by the scratchy / smeary looking surface of the glass - if you have photoshop elements the heal tool might have helped a bit...  i have noted the presence of shadows, but i don''t think it''s really a prominent enough a feature to really fit the challenge...  i do still like it though - the more i look at it the more striking it feels.  it''s also cute.  erm, 6.</td>', 'i like the variety of colours, and also the picture gives a clear impression of what it would be like to touch the toad / frog, it conveying texture very well...  i personally might have tried cropping within the confines of edges of the glass container, as the background (or the fact that the picture isn''t quite level) is more of a distraction.  this picture is also let down slightly by the scratchy / smeary looking surface of the glass - if you have photoshop elements the heal tool might have helped a bit...  i have noted the presence of shadows, but i don''t think it''s really a prominent enough a feature to really fit the challenge...  i do still like it though - the more i look at it the more striking it feels.  it''s also cute.  erm, 6.', '2006-06-13 04:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2511744, 346505, 16004, '<td valign="top">bit too psycheadelic possibly; and regrettably it does feel like it''s been post-processed to within an inch of its life - would imagine it''s too digital looking for a lot of voters. not sure it strictly fits the challenge; i see there''s shadows, but they could just as easily be black question marks.  it''s certainly creative and original (and brave, here), and merit should be awarded for that.   i keep thinking with some polishing, and maybe a squarer crop, it would make a good record sleeve.  5.</td>', 'bit too psycheadelic possibly; and regrettably it does feel like it''s been post-processed to within an inch of its life - would imagine it''s too digital looking for a lot of voters. not sure it strictly fits the challenge; i see there''s shadows, but they could just as easily be black question marks.  it''s certainly creative and original (and brave, here), and merit should be awarded for that.   i keep thinking with some polishing, and maybe a squarer crop, it would make a good record sleeve.  5.', '2006-06-13 04:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2511749, 345387, 59945, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2006-06-13 04:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2511750, 345842, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful and striking image.  the red is a lovely lovely choice of colour; it''s oddly sexy as well.  i love this so much; the shapes, the mood, it''s simplicity, it''s fantastic application of shadows, everything.  a very high quality shot, and deserves to do super-well.  10.</td>', 'this is a beautiful and striking image.  the red is a lovely lovely choice of colour; it''s oddly sexy as well.  i love this so much; the shapes, the mood, it''s simplicity, it''s fantastic application of shadows, everything.  a very high quality shot, and deserves to do super-well.  10.', '2006-06-13 04:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2511760, 345354, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is one of my favourite 3 of the challenge.  it''s brilliantly amusing, it''s a perfect example of using shadow to full effect, it''s creative, and thoroughly enjoyable.  the pose is just super.  best example of meeting the challenge i have seen.  well done.  gave this a 10.</td>', 'this is one of my favourite 3 of the challenge.  it''s brilliantly amusing, it''s a perfect example of using shadow to full effect, it''s creative, and thoroughly enjoyable.  the pose is just super.  best example of meeting the challenge i have seen.  well done.  gave this a 10.', '2006-06-13 04:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2511916, 345822, 44453, '<td valign="top">thats really cool, the petals look like porcelain.  the composition doesn''t do a lot for you though. I would have liked to see a bit more negative space around the flower</td>', 'thats really cool, the petals look like porcelain.  the composition doesn''t do a lot for you though. I would have liked to see a bit more negative space around the flower', '2006-06-13 07:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2511935, 345087, 44453, '<td valign="top">would be much better if there was only the shadow of the fly - you really should have got rid of the shadow in the bottom corner somehow. Otherwise its a great photo</td>', 'would be much better if there was only the shadow of the fly - you really should have got rid of the shadow in the bottom corner somehow. Otherwise its a great photo', '2006-06-13 07:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2511937, 345930, 44453, '<td valign="top">one of the best of the challenge IMO! hope this does well</td>', 'one of the best of the challenge IMO! hope this does well', '2006-06-13 07:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
