(2512452, 345957, 34938, '<td valign="top">I love the pose and lighting here...it''s really fresh and alive...10</td>', 'I love the pose and lighting here...it''s really fresh and alive...10', '2006-06-13 11:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512496, 345387, 33068, '<td valign="top">Good eye.</td>', 'Good eye.', '2006-06-13 11:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512554, 346273, 56828, '<td valign="top">The whole photo here looks very blurry.  More focus and possibly a different angle could improve the photo.</td>', 'The whole photo here looks very blurry.  More focus and possibly a different angle could improve the photo.', '2006-06-13 12:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512557, 345888, 56828, '<td valign="top">The photo is extremely blurry.  Not only that, it''s not a shadow...it''s a bird flying with the lighting being too dark to pick up the color.</td>', 'The photo is extremely blurry.  Not only that, it''s not a shadow...it''s a bird flying with the lighting being too dark to pick up the color.', '2006-06-13 12:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512561, 344409, 56828, '<td valign="top">I''m at odds here, because what you pictured is a reflection and not a shadow.  I didn''t consider that much in my voting though.  The photo looks too busy.  there are too many boats and buildings in the back ground.  You could have enhanced the boat color too, to make it stand out more from the other boats.</td>', 'I''m at odds here, because what you pictured is a reflection and not a shadow.  I didn''t consider that much in my voting though.  The photo looks too busy.  there are too many boats and buildings in the back ground.  You could have enhanced the boat color too, to make it stand out more from the other boats.', '2006-06-13 12:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512563, 346410, 56828, '<td valign="top">Simplicity works here.  Would have like to see more focus though.</td>', 'Simplicity works here.  Would have like to see more focus though.', '2006-06-13 12:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512567, 346301, 56828, '<td valign="top">This could have been a very good photo.  i think you took a bad angle on the wall.  I understand you wanted to make sure you weren''t in the photo, but the upward angle brings into too much distracting light in the upper right corner.  Also you should have found a spot that did not contain the chipped paint area.  Lastly if you could have caught just a little bit of the wall under the bridge, it would have looked nicer.</td>', 'This could have been a very good photo.  i think you took a bad angle on the wall.  I understand you wanted to make sure you weren''t in the photo, but the upward angle brings into too much distracting light in the upper right corner.  Also you should have found a spot that did not contain the chipped paint area.  Lastly if you could have caught just a little bit of the wall under the bridge, it would have looked nicer.', '2006-06-13 12:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512579, 346003, 56828, '<td valign="top">There isn''t much focus on a shadow here.  From a technical aspect, I think it would have been better if you had the plant up front.  in the top left corner there is a green plant blocking part of it and at the bottom center there is dead area in font of it.  Those are sort of distracting from the photo.</td>', 'There isn''t much focus on a shadow here.  From a technical aspect, I think it would have been better if you had the plant up front.  in the top left corner there is a green plant blocking part of it and at the bottom center there is dead area in font of it.  Those are sort of distracting from the photo.', '2006-06-13 12:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512583, 346442, 56828, '<td valign="top">I think the arched or balloon effect you put on the photo really takes away from the photo.</td>', 'I think the arched or balloon effect you put on the photo really takes away from the photo.', '2006-06-13 12:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
