(2513648, 346289, 6999, '<td valign="top">A pleasantly strange image - though, overall, perhaps you might have done more to brighten the whole thing - I appreciate the darkness'' point in this image, but it''s perhaps a touch over-done. Not convinced the shadow element is terribly important to it, either.</td>', 'A pleasantly strange image - though, overall, perhaps you might have done more to brighten the whole thing - I appreciate the darkness'' point in this image, but it''s perhaps a touch over-done. Not convinced the shadow element is terribly important to it, either.', '2006-06-13 18:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513650, 345888, 4267, '<td valign="top">not really a shadow.. this is a silhouette...<br/> <br/>does not meet the challenge...<br/> <br/>as for the photo I''m not fond of the blur effect here</td>', 'not really a shadow.. this is a silhouette... does not meet the challenge... as for the photo I''m not fond of the blur effect here', '2006-06-13 18:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513654, 345432, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and the blown-out highlights add a kind of ''surveillance'' feel to the image, which adds some drama. Overall, perhaps just a bit too fantasy and unlikely a situation for my taste - I find it kind of emotion-free and meaningless, but I''m with the goove of it, certainly.</td>', 'I like the idea, and the blown-out highlights add a kind of ''surveillance'' feel to the image, which adds some drama. Overall, perhaps just a bit too fantasy and unlikely a situation for my taste - I find it kind of emotion-free and meaningless, but I''m with the goove of it, certainly.', '2006-06-13 18:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513655, 346508, 4267, '<td valign="top">interesting shadow... would like the light source to be a little brighter</td>', 'interesting shadow... would like the light source to be a little brighter', '2006-06-13 18:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513663, 346181, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure there''s enough sense of peaceful composition here to really njustify your title; the shadows are rather hectic, and actually the blalnce of the positioning of the two leaves or whatever is slightly uncomfortably - quite apart from the zen idea of the manipulation of materials being outside my understanding of the groove. There is, however, a certain feel of lightness to it - down to your exemplary capture of a sense of brightness without blasting the highlights - which fits your title.</td>', 'I''m not sure there''s enough sense of peaceful composition here to really njustify your title; the shadows are rather hectic, and actually the blalnce of the positioning of the two leaves or whatever is slightly uncomfortably - quite apart from the zen idea of the manipulation of materials being outside my understanding of the groove. There is, however, a certain feel of lightness to it - down to your exemplary capture of a sense of brightness without blasting the highlights - which fits your title.', '2006-06-13 19:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513669, 346360, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting, arresting image; the sudden shift into sharpness grabs at the eye, and that sharpness itself is very well handled. Can''t imagine that you''ll hit the old challenge nail very squarely on the head though, but not a bad image at all.</td>', 'Interesting, arresting image; the sudden shift into sharpness grabs at the eye, and that sharpness itself is very well handled. Can''t imagine that you''ll hit the old challenge nail very squarely on the head though, but not a bad image at all.', '2006-06-13 19:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513672, 344678, 6999, '<td valign="top">Yes, they do. Beyond that ... well, I don''t see a photographic point to this. Without shadow our images are a collection of colours, so I think this is hardly getting into the spirit of this challenge. Composition is poor also - a simple documenting of a bloom, of which there are many many thousnad versions, and there is nothing special here I''m afraid.</td>', 'Yes, they do. Beyond that ... well, I don''t see a photographic point to this. Without shadow our images are a collection of colours, so I think this is hardly getting into the spirit of this challenge. Composition is poor also - a simple documenting of a bloom, of which there are many many thousnad versions, and there is nothing special here I''m afraid.', '2006-06-13 19:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513682, 345894, 6999, '<td valign="top">For an image that depends on a subtle graduation of light and shade, your border is extrordinarily imposing and clunky; your handling of the highlights of this image doesn''t seem to be in your control either - and the broad white band of that border just adds proof to the sense that you''ve taken the highlights too far and lost all sense of detail. Compositionally, it might well have worked extremely well, but it shows evidence of not understanding whay exposure was required and controlling that in post-processing. You have, nevertheless, achieved a strong sense of heat, which might have stoof the image in good stead if the subject demanded it - but a still life - I can''t see how this feeling of out-of-control exposure sits with the image you''re presenting. Shows a strong sense fo composition, spatially, also.<br/> <br/>A good attempt, I''d say; but needing more expertise to be brought to bear.</td>', 'For an image that depends on a subtle graduation of light and shade, your border is extrordinarily imposing and clunky; your handling of the highlights of this image doesn''t seem to be in your control either - and the broad white band of that border just adds proof to the sense that you''ve taken the highlights too far and lost all sense of detail. Compositionally, it might well have worked extremely well, but it shows evidence of not understanding whay exposure was required and controlling that in post-processing. You have, nevertheless, achieved a strong sense of heat, which might have stoof the image in good stead if the subject demanded it - but a still life - I can''t see how this feeling of out-of-control exposure sits with the image you''re presenting. Shows a strong sense fo composition, spatially, also. A good attempt, I''d say; but needing more expertise to be brought to bear.', '2006-06-13 19:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513702, 346489, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting -  and I''m more certain that most other ovters will eb in the same boat - what shadows have to do with this image in a way they don''t with any photograph whatsoever. Obviously, all mono images absolutely depend upon shadow, or perhaps rather light and shade, otherwise they would be simple grey planes, but I think to take that as your launching-point is to wilfully not engage with the idea of the challenge, and tus the point of DPC. <br/> <br/>Nice enough image, though perhaps lacking any real fascination - and hardly an unknown scene, really: though you''ve given us a strong sense of the ''suspension'' element of the bridge, which is good to see.</td>', 'I''m not getting -  and I''m more certain that most other ovters will eb in the same boat - what shadows have to do with this image in a way they don''t with any photograph whatsoever. Obviously, all mono images absolutely depend upon shadow, or perhaps rather light and shade, otherwise they would be simple grey planes, but I think to take that as your launching-point is to wilfully not engage with the idea of the challenge, and tus the point of DPC.  Nice enough image, though perhaps lacking any real fascination - and hardly an unknown scene, really: though you''ve given us a strong sense of the ''suspension'' element of the bridge, which is good to see.', '2006-06-13 19:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513716, 344988, 6999, '<td valign="top">Thi9s touches on one of the intereswting phenomena of shadows -  that of their absolute relationship to the object that forms them, and of their paradoxical difference of scale. However, that element alone isn''t, i think, enough to support this as an artistic endeavour: a quite interesting little ornament, but your set-up lacks the hyper-cleanliness to give it punch - the edge of the table, the dust-motes - and I would far rather see something like this incorporated into a more real world, to give true impact.</td>', 'Thi9s touches on one of the intereswting phenomena of shadows -  that of their absolute relationship to the object that forms them, and of their paradoxical difference of scale. However, that element alone isn''t, i think, enough to support this as an artistic endeavour: a quite interesting little ornament, but your set-up lacks the hyper-cleanliness to give it punch - the edge of the table, the dust-motes - and I would far rather see something like this incorporated into a more real world, to give true impact.', '2006-06-13 19:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513763, 346186, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice effect overall.  I just find the guy a bit too centred for my liking.  Cropping a bit off the right would work better for me.  Others may disagree, however.</td>', 'Nice effect overall.  I just find the guy a bit too centred for my liking.  Cropping a bit off the right would work better for me.  Others may disagree, however.', '2006-06-13 19:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513787, 346076, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is so unoriginal by now I don''t know how to rate it....I''m very tired of this image on DPC. Can we please retire it once and for all????? I can see someone maybe wanting to reproduce it as a practical exercise but must it keep popping up in challenges. Does originality count for nothing?</td>', 'This is so unoriginal by now I don''t know how to rate it....I''m very tired of this image on DPC. Can we please retire it once and for all????? I can see someone maybe wanting to reproduce it as a practical exercise but must it keep popping up in challenges. Does originality count for nothing?', '2006-06-13 19:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513790, 346171, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice mood. It definitely captures the mood your title is aiming for. Great exposure.</td>', 'Very nice mood. It definitely captures the mood your title is aiming for. Great exposure.', '2006-06-13 19:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513818, 346501, 46314, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea behind this photo. A really effective use of shadows.</td>', 'I really like the idea behind this photo. A really effective use of shadows.', '2006-06-13 20:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513819, 346166, 46314, '<td valign="top">Clever choice of colour for this shot.</td>', 'Clever choice of colour for this shot.', '2006-06-13 20:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513820, 345829, 6519, '<td valign="top">I would have cloned out the distraction in the upper left hand corner (pink string??). Still very nice, though. 7</td>', 'I would have cloned out the distraction in the upper left hand corner (pink string??). Still very nice, though. 7', '2006-06-13 20:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513822, 345956, 46314, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. Shows how shadows can be used to balance a composition in the same way that reflections are usually used over water. And great colour too.</td>', 'I really like this photo. Shows how shadows can be used to balance a composition in the same way that reflections are usually used over water. And great colour too.', '2006-06-13 20:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513824, 345356, 6519, '<td valign="top">Whilst, for a number of reasons, the "illusion" isn''t at all convincing, the idea is  still cute. 7</td>', 'Whilst, for a number of reasons, the "illusion" isn''t at all convincing, the idea is  still cute. 7', '2006-06-13 20:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513827, 346502, 46314, '<td valign="top">Well lit and composed.</td>', 'Well lit and composed.', '2006-06-13 20:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513828, 346220, 6519, '<td valign="top">For a photo to do really well in a challenge called "Shadows", those shadows must play a major role in the image. In this case, they are secondary at best.... several other elements create the impact.</td>', 'For a photo to do really well in a challenge called "Shadows", those shadows must play a major role in the image. In this case, they are secondary at best.... several other elements create the impact.', '2006-06-13 20:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513830, 344459, 6519, '<td valign="top">The execution could have possibly been a bit better, but the idea is great! 7</td>', 'The execution could have possibly been a bit better, but the idea is great! 7', '2006-06-13 20:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513835, 346304, 6519, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.... in a way, the fingers are bothering me, but I understand that you had to show them so we could work out what it is we''re seeing.<br/>Interesting concept.... it really is all about the light, but the shadows are most certainly there. 7</td>', 'Hmmm.... in a way, the fingers are bothering me, but I understand that you had to show them so we could work out what it is we''re seeing.Interesting concept.... it really is all about the light, but the shadows are most certainly there. 7', '2006-06-13 20:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513838, 346296, 6519, '<td valign="top">The shadow in the photo is rather incidental, but it is a very cute shot with nice composition and great leading lines. 7</td>', 'The shadow in the photo is rather incidental, but it is a very cute shot with nice composition and great leading lines. 7', '2006-06-13 20:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513857, 346250, 46314, '<td valign="top">Would be improved if the flower was in sharper focus.</td>', 'Would be improved if the flower was in sharper focus.', '2006-06-13 20:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513865, 346276, 46314, '<td valign="top">The shadow doesn''t seem strong enough. Maybe darker and sharper would improve it. I liked the idea.</td>', 'The shadow doesn''t seem strong enough. Maybe darker and sharper would improve it. I liked the idea.', '2006-06-13 20:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513896, 344856, 46314, '<td valign="top">Brilliant composition. And the bleached look really works - places emphasis on the shadows that wouldn''t be there in full colour.</td>', 'Brilliant composition. And the bleached look really works - places emphasis on the shadows that wouldn''t be there in full colour.', '2006-06-13 21:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513901, 346096, 46314, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t like blown out highlights, but sometimes the work. In this shot the explosion of light into the shot matches the movement of the girl bursting into the scene. And the long shadow in the foreground not only draws our eye to the girl, but also creates depth for the girl to ''move'' into.</td>', 'Normally I don''t like blown out highlights, but sometimes the work. In this shot the explosion of light into the shot matches the movement of the girl bursting into the scene. And the long shadow in the foreground not only draws our eye to the girl, but also creates depth for the girl to ''move'' into.', '2006-06-13 21:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513908, 346494, 46314, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of the composition here. The other thing I really like is the sharpness of the shadow. I''ve seen lots of entries where the shadow is just too fuzzy to make any impact.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of the composition here. The other thing I really like is the sharpness of the shadow. I''ve seen lots of entries where the shadow is just too fuzzy to make any impact.', '2006-06-13 21:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513910, 346264, 18197, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. Well executed.</td>', 'Clever idea. Well executed.', '2006-06-13 21:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513911, 346508, 46314, '<td valign="top">I think you need more contrast in this image, and stronger lighting. That would serve to silhouette the model more, and bring out a sharper and stronger shadow on the wall.</td>', 'I think you need more contrast in this image, and stronger lighting. That would serve to silhouette the model more, and bring out a sharper and stronger shadow on the wall.', '2006-06-13 21:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513913, 346383, 46314, '<td valign="top">Terrific lines in this image.</td>', 'Terrific lines in this image.', '2006-06-13 21:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513915, 346503, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice, simple composition, uses shadow well.</td>', 'Very nice, simple composition, uses shadow well.', '2006-06-13 21:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513916, 346296, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but the shadow is lost in this image. It doesn''t form a central element to the photo, otherwise I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'Nice photo, but the shadow is lost in this image. It doesn''t form a central element to the photo, otherwise I would have scored it higher.', '2006-06-13 21:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513917, 345956, 12733, '<td valign="top">A very pretty use of shadow to emphasize the shape.</td>', 'A very pretty use of shadow to emphasize the shape.', '2006-06-13 21:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513920, 346250, 12733, '<td valign="top">The image and the shadow play off each other nicely.</td>', 'The image and the shadow play off each other nicely.', '2006-06-13 21:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513921, 345387, 46314, '<td valign="top">Terrific pattern. I think you could have made even more impact with it if you''d cropped tighter, getting rid of the distracting elements (lamposts and birds).</td>', 'Terrific pattern. I think you could have made even more impact with it if you''d cropped tighter, getting rid of the distracting elements (lamposts and birds).', '2006-06-13 21:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513922, 346334, 46314, '<td valign="top">Brilliant lines. Shadows used to great effect.</td>', 'Brilliant lines. Shadows used to great effect.', '2006-06-13 21:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513926, 343655, 18197, '<td valign="top">Actually it''s the moon''s shadow, not the earth''s. Still a very nice capture with very nice sharp detail. Well done.</td>', 'Actually it''s the moon''s shadow, not the earth''s. Still a very nice capture with very nice sharp detail. Well done.', '2006-06-13 21:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513931, 346449, 46314, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but for the theme I would have preferred of the shadows were more important in the picture.</td>', 'Great photo, but for the theme I would have preferred of the shadows were more important in the picture.', '2006-06-13 21:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513934, 345202, 35645, '<td valign="top">I think what throws this off for me (challenge-wise) is that the subject seems to be the bear rather than the shadow. Also, the composition seems a little static with the bear and shadow in the center of the pic. I think that if they were in the lower third it might work a little better - give it a little more sense of being out in the wilderness.<br/>I also think that this would work better for the challenge if the shadow had a little more definition to it...if it looked more like the outline of the bear.<br/>It''s not a bad shot of a bear, but for a ''shadow'' challenge, it''s lacking a little ''oomph'' in the shadow area.</td>', 'I think what throws this off for me (challenge-wise) is that the subject seems to be the bear rather than the shadow. Also, the composition seems a little static with the bear and shadow in the center of the pic. I think that if they were in the lower third it might work a little better - give it a little more sense of being out in the wilderness.I also think that this would work better for the challenge if the shadow had a little more definition to it...if it looked more like the outline of the bear.It''s not a bad shot of a bear, but for a ''shadow'' challenge, it''s lacking a little ''oomph'' in the shadow area.', '2006-06-13 21:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513935, 345116, 46314, '<td valign="top">I really like the use of the shadows in this picture... The pulling of hair idea is full of humour. How long did it take you to get them in that exact pose?</td>', 'I really like the use of the shadows in this picture... The pulling of hair idea is full of humour. How long did it take you to get them in that exact pose?', '2006-06-13 21:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513939, 345927, 46314, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. The muted and geometric background is visually appealing, but doesn''t distract from the subject. And the shadow is prominent and sharp. The almost silhouetted shape is a strong and bold shape. Really eyecatching composition.</td>', 'Brilliant. The muted and geometric background is visually appealing, but doesn''t distract from the subject. And the shadow is prominent and sharp. The almost silhouetted shape is a strong and bold shape. Really eyecatching composition.', '2006-06-13 21:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513942, 345168, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the angular pun. Made me stop and look. That takes an unusual photo. Good work.</td>', 'I like the angular pun. Made me stop and look. That takes an unusual photo. Good work.', '2006-06-13 21:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513943, 346153, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern. Strong use of colour and line.</td>', 'Nice pattern. Strong use of colour and line.', '2006-06-13 21:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513945, 344459, 46314, '<td valign="top">That''s frightening. Very nice lighting and tone.</td>', 'That''s frightening. Very nice lighting and tone.', '2006-06-13 21:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513953, 346468, 46314, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally like wineglass shots, but I loved the delicate shadow patterns in this one.</td>', 'I don''t normally like wineglass shots, but I loved the delicate shadow patterns in this one.', '2006-06-13 21:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513954, 345477, 46314, '<td valign="top">Lovely bold colours.</td>', 'Lovely bold colours.', '2006-06-13 21:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513959, 346417, 46314, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. Would have preferred a stronger and sharper shadow. The bold foreground object tends to overpower the ''clinking of the glasses'' part of the image.</td>', 'Clever idea. Would have preferred a stronger and sharper shadow. The bold foreground object tends to overpower the ''clinking of the glasses'' part of the image.', '2006-06-13 21:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513962, 346264, 46314, '<td valign="top">Terrific idea. Well executed.</td>', 'Terrific idea. Well executed.', '2006-06-13 21:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
