(2513972, 346489, 46314, '<td valign="top">Would have enjoyed more tonal range - maybe tweak the contrast up a few notches. Probably could have gotten the brides to stand out more that way (especially if tweaking was done on the red channel - that is the Golden Gate right?)</td>', 'Would have enjoyed more tonal range - maybe tweak the contrast up a few notches. Probably could have gotten the brides to stand out more that way (especially if tweaking was done on the red channel - that is the Golden Gate right?)', '2006-06-13 21:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
