(2519425, 346412, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''ve no idea if the shadows, at least in the literal sense, are critical to the success of this image.  And I don''t much care, either; it''s a beautiful celebration of light and texture.  Plus the avocado injects a nice allusion to life and death, too, or at least to the cyclical nature of life.  8.</td>', 'I''ve no idea if the shadows, at least in the literal sense, are critical to the success of this image.  And I don''t much care, either; it''s a beautiful celebration of light and texture.  Plus the avocado injects a nice allusion to life and death, too, or at least to the cyclical nature of life.  8.', '2006-06-15 07:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2519426, 345396, 27133, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of the morning sun.....love those rays and colours.</td>', 'Very nice capture of the morning sun.....love those rays and colours.', '2006-06-15 07:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2519427, 346246, 27133, '<td valign="top">Hehehe..this is good...great details.</td>', 'Hehehe..this is good...great details.', '2006-06-15 07:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2519430, 346273, 27133, '<td valign="top">The focus is a little out but the idea is good.  It looks to me like this was taken over some distance....try getting a bit closer and using either a tripod or gently push the camera down into a support to prevent shake.</td>', 'The focus is a little out but the idea is good.  It looks to me like this was taken over some distance....try getting a bit closer and using either a tripod or gently push the camera down into a support to prevent shake.', '2006-06-15 07:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
