(2519456, 345894, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely, thoughtful photograph.  It has a lot more to offer than at first appears ... life, growth, decay, neglect; all that stuff and probably more.  And it''s quiet, too; nothing gimmicky, obvious or flashy about it.  That gives it the durability and timelessness that any genuine Still Life ought to have.  8.</td>', 'This is a lovely, thoughtful photograph.  It has a lot more to offer than at first appears ... life, growth, decay, neglect; all that stuff and probably more.  And it''s quiet, too; nothing gimmicky, obvious or flashy about it.  That gives it the durability and timelessness that any genuine Still Life ought to have.  8.', '2006-06-15 08:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2519457, 345195, 27133, '<td valign="top">Hehehehe...clever thinking.</td>', 'Hehehehe...clever thinking.', '2006-06-15 08:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
