(2519475, 346502, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is such a DPC-friendly image that my first instinct was to dismiss it immediately.  Simple, bright red, graphically bold, intellectually undemanding, looks great as a thumbnail ... it''s got all the ingredients.  But I can''t condemn it for all that; in spite of first impressions, it actually has some substance to it.  And it''s beautifully executed, too.  7.</td>', 'This is such a DPC-friendly image that my first instinct was to dismiss it immediately.  Simple, bright red, graphically bold, intellectually undemanding, looks great as a thumbnail ... it''s got all the ingredients.  But I can''t condemn it for all that; in spite of first impressions, it actually has some substance to it.  And it''s beautifully executed, too.  7.', '2006-06-15 08:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
