(2519488, 346334, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautifully executed ... the tones and colour are perfect and the overall effect is to suggest something other than what it actually is.  I suppose that''s more farm abstract than zen, but the suggestion of those raked sand zen gardens is undeniable.  8.</td>', 'Beautifully executed ... the tones and colour are perfect and the overall effect is to suggest something other than what it actually is.  I suppose that''s more farm abstract than zen, but the suggestion of those raked sand zen gardens is undeniable.  8.', '2006-06-15 08:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
