(2519657, 345325, 56828, '<td valign="top">The red coloring adds to this photo.  I''m not a fan of hte light streak between the hand and the glass on the left side, but it doesn''t take away from the photo at all.</td>', 'The red coloring adds to this photo.  I''m not a fan of hte light streak between the hand and the glass on the left side, but it doesn''t take away from the photo at all.', '2006-06-15 09:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
