(2520135, 346273, 48717, '<td valign="top">The focus is going to hurt you here, a faster shutter speed would have done the trick.  It seemed to be a pretty bright day, so you could have increased your ISO and set a faster shutter on TV mode instead of letting the camera choose your settings.  <br/> <br/>Otherwise - good shadow, colors and exposure.  I would have cropped out the fence in the lowere portion of the picture.</td>', 'The focus is going to hurt you here, a faster shutter speed would have done the trick.  It seemed to be a pretty bright day, so you could have increased your ISO and set a faster shutter on TV mode instead of letting the camera choose your settings.   Otherwise - good shadow, colors and exposure.  I would have cropped out the fence in the lowere portion of the picture.', '2006-06-15 13:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
