(2520589, 345116, 43410, '<td valign="top">great shot.  only thing is the blowouts on this one, in the hair/arms from the sun being directly ahead.  might have used a faster shutter speed.  the far bacground is somewhat distracting as well.  these kids are definitely adorable, and spite what i pointed out, this is definitely a great capture.  looking forward to seeing more pictures from you of these darling children.  5<br/> <br/>good luck!</td>', 'great shot.  only thing is the blowouts on this one, in the hair/arms from the sun being directly ahead.  might have used a faster shutter speed.  the far bacground is somewhat distracting as well.  these kids are definitely adorable, and spite what i pointed out, this is definitely a great capture.  looking forward to seeing more pictures from you of these darling children.  5 good luck!', '2006-06-15 17:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
