(2521451, 344856, 50982, '<td valign="top">So pretty. Just too centered IMO. Panning the pic up more so the horizon is lower. However, having said that it would mean plenty of dark sky. (8)</td>', 'So pretty. Just too centered IMO. Panning the pic up more so the horizon is lower. However, having said that it would mean plenty of dark sky. (8)', '2006-06-15 22:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2521456, 346498, 50982, '<td valign="top">NARF! Only beef is that I''d have preferred all the little buggers to have been in sharper focus. Or at least more of them. Or maybe a lower angle would pull this more towards a focused spot for the eye to grab? (8)</td>', 'NARF! Only beef is that I''d have preferred all the little buggers to have been in sharper focus. Or at least more of them. Or maybe a lower angle would pull this more towards a focused spot for the eye to grab? (8)', '2006-06-15 22:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2521489, 346034, 33672, '<td valign="top">Simple shapes, colors and curves.Extraordinary job.</td>', 'Simple shapes, colors and curves.Extraordinary job.', '2006-06-15 22:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2521492, 346474, 33672, '<td valign="top">I love the declaration of independence.... Nice comp, including use of negative space, lighting and tones. Great subject abd very emotive, At least to me.</td>', 'I love the declaration of independence.... Nice comp, including use of negative space, lighting and tones. Great subject abd very emotive, At least to me.', '2006-06-15 22:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2521495, 346276, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice effect that really needs more contrast to really make an impression. Nice light gradient.</td>', 'Nice effect that really needs more contrast to really make an impression. Nice light gradient.', '2006-06-15 22:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2521497, 345930, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great comp and geometric design. I like the tones and the shapes. Nice use of contrast.</td>', 'Great comp and geometric design. I like the tones and the shapes. Nice use of contrast.', '2006-06-15 22:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2521698, 346177, 18367, '<td valign="top">Truly amazing how you managed to take a few simple, readily available items and combine them to make a striking image.<br/> <br/>I commend you on your resourcefulness, ingenuity and photographic savoir faire.  Very well done indeed.</td>', 'Truly amazing how you managed to take a few simple, readily available items and combine them to make a striking image. I commend you on your resourcefulness, ingenuity and photographic savoir faire.  Very well done indeed.', '2006-06-16 00:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2521700, 345927, 18367, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this image and can hardly wait to find out how you managed this shot, as I am certain are countless others. A great photo which meets a the prescribed criteria, and executed to perfection.</td>', 'I absolutely love this image and can hardly wait to find out how you managed this shot, as I am certain are countless others. A great photo which meets a the prescribed criteria, and executed to perfection.', '2006-06-16 00:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2521701, 345432, 18367, '<td valign="top">This is by far the most innovative interpretation of the challenge I have seen thus far. You truly have captured the shadow, and have also managed to convey a message that women are often captives of their environment.<br/> <br/>Very well done.</td>', 'This is by far the most innovative interpretation of the challenge I have seen thus far. You truly have captured the shadow, and have also managed to convey a message that women are often captives of their environment. Very well done.', '2006-06-16 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2521714, 346505, 51802, '<td valign="top">This is too close to digital art for my taste.  Although this image may have started in a camera, I do not think of this as a photograph.</td>', 'This is too close to digital art for my taste.  Although this image may have started in a camera, I do not think of this as a photograph.', '2006-06-16 00:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
