(2525678, 345955, 14414, '<td valign="top">I like how the shadows bring out the frog/toad''s texture, but feel the inclusion of the edges of the jar (especially as they''re wonky) distract in a major way.</td>', 'I like how the shadows bring out the frog/toad''s texture, but feel the inclusion of the edges of the jar (especially as they''re wonky) distract in a major way.', '2006-06-18 05:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
