(2527380, 345356, 48560, '<td valign="top">this is good, Dan! Some of the commentors felt that the photo is humorous, which I think is true, but my personal take is, it felt a little sad, because it is like the diner is hoping he could have a better meal instead of the bread and canned sardine on his table. Good and creative take (as usual!)</td>', 'this is good, Dan! Some of the commentors felt that the photo is humorous, which I think is true, but my personal take is, it felt a little sad, because it is like the diner is hoping he could have a better meal instead of the bread and canned sardine on his table. Good and creative take (as usual!)', '2006-06-19 01:13:13.000000', NULL, 0),
