(2528034, 344878, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oops!  Guess I tried to be too creative?  Maybe it looked like a "shoehorn" image?  Title too long?  Hmmm...<br/> <br/>Well, I thought it was cute the way the squirrel was using the shadow of the tree to become a shadow as well (to hide/peek around).  <br/> <br/>I like the sunlight just showing on the squirrel''s nose and top of the head.  To me it illustrates that he/she is showing just enough of itself to see what''s going on on the other side of the tree.<br/> <br/>Camera in hand, and still smiling.  ;^)</td>', 'Oops!  Guess I tried to be too creative?  Maybe it looked like a "shoehorn" image?  Title too long?  Hmmm... Well, I thought it was cute the way the squirrel was using the shadow of the tree to become a shadow as well (to hide/peek around).   I like the sunlight just showing on the squirrel''s nose and top of the head.  To me it illustrates that he/she is showing just enough of itself to see what''s going on on the other side of the tree. Camera in hand, and still smiling.  ;^)', '2006-06-19 08:56:34.000000', NULL, 0),
