(2530175, 346453, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment:<br/> <br/>Definitely meets the challenge, but lacks a little in interest other than meeting the challenge.  The silhouette is pleasing, but I think it might have been better on a softer surface since your model is a delicate young woman (it appears she is here - she may be a total tomboy for all I know!)  I also think it might have been nice to see just a bit of the caster of the shadow, ie find an angle such that you get just a bit of her hands or maybe the back of her head.  Another way to add some interest would be to have something in the shot, such as the edge of the bed or a nightstand with some flowers on it or such.</td>', 'Trading Post comment: Definitely meets the challenge, but lacks a little in interest other than meeting the challenge.  The silhouette is pleasing, but I think it might have been better on a softer surface since your model is a delicate young woman (it appears she is here - she may be a total tomboy for all I know!)  I also think it might have been nice to see just a bit of the caster of the shadow, ie find an angle such that you get just a bit of her hands or maybe the back of her head.  Another way to add some interest would be to have something in the shot, such as the edge of the bed or a nightstand with some flowers on it or such.', '2006-06-19 22:28:12.000000', NULL, 0),
