(2530189, 346177, 22734, '<td valign="top">Both creatuve, colorful and funny. Congratulations on your 11th place finish.</td>', 'Both creatuve, colorful and funny. Congratulations on your 11th place finish.', '2006-06-19 22:31:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530191, 346264, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 12th placing. Very well done!</td>', 'Congratulations on your 12th placing. Very well done!', '2006-06-19 22:31:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530193, 344917, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment:<br/> <br/>Heh!  I like this one!  I love that you used filters to get the colors - I''d never have known that.  Very clever!  It looks vibrant and rich, but not overly processed to me.  I like how the figure and the shadow are both in the frame, but the shadow more fully developed in the "action" by being attached to the rope.  Met the challenge well and would make a nice poster for a kid''s room, I think!</td>', 'Trading Post comment: Heh!  I like this one!  I love that you used filters to get the colors - I''d never have known that.  Very clever!  It looks vibrant and rich, but not overly processed to me.  I like how the figure and the shadow are both in the frame, but the shadow more fully developed in the "action" by being attached to the rope.  Met the challenge well and would make a nice poster for a kid''s room, I think!', '2006-06-19 22:32:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530196, 346096, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image impressed me at once and I am glad it finished with a 6.5+<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'This image impressed me at once and I am glad it finished with a 6.5+ Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-06-19 22:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530199, 346153, 22734, '<td valign="top">Hood imagination in selecting and making this composition. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Hood imagination in selecting and making this composition. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-06-19 22:33:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530203, 345304, 22734, '<td valign="top">Simply lovely as it offers the hidden meaning of the mask per se. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Simply lovely as it offers the hidden meaning of the mask per se. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-06-19 22:34:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530205, 346494, 22734, '<td valign="top">Outstanding composition with a direct message. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Outstanding composition with a direct message. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-06-19 22:35:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530208, 345168, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great light angle to produce this fine shadow study. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Great light angle to produce this fine shadow study. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-06-19 22:35:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530210, 345930, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great find for this challeng and fine presentation. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Great find for this challeng and fine presentation. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-06-19 22:36:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530214, 345842, 22734, '<td valign="top">Whimsical, sweet and endearing. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Whimsical, sweet and endearing. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-06-19 22:36:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530216, 345354, 22734, '<td valign="top">Impressive shadow image. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Impressive shadow image. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-06-19 22:37:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530236, 346322, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment:<br/> <br/>When voting, I thought this very much looked like a metal tree of some kind but I wasn''t sure about the fence part.  It does form a nice abstract.  I think it would be kinda cool to see it in color - shadows don''t have to be gray.  I think the fact it''s a little fuzzy and ghosted in places may have affected the score, and I suspect part of that fuzziness is the slow shutter speed, though it does kinda create a neat effect - almost haunted looking.</td>', 'Trading Post comment: When voting, I thought this very much looked like a metal tree of some kind but I wasn''t sure about the fence part.  It does form a nice abstract.  I think it would be kinda cool to see it in color - shadows don''t have to be gray.  I think the fact it''s a little fuzzy and ghosted in places may have affected the score, and I suspect part of that fuzziness is the slow shutter speed, though it does kinda create a neat effect - almost haunted looking.', '2006-06-19 22:43:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530300, 345484, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment:<br/> <br/>This was indeed one of my favorites in the challenge - I gave you an 8.  I love this kind of light/shadow play and it''s ever so challenging to capture the rays without washing out parts.  Your choice of the angle for composition with only a bit of sky really helps in that respect, I think.  Nice choice of a very lush green setting, too.  I was thinking maybe you could crop a bit off the left, but when I tried that, I didn''t like it as well.  It seems nicely balanced as is.  Another 6+, another good placing.  Even if you did steal the wife''s shot and she beat you anyway.  :-)</td>', 'Trading Post comment: This was indeed one of my favorites in the challenge - I gave you an 8.  I love this kind of light/shadow play and it''s ever so challenging to capture the rays without washing out parts.  Your choice of the angle for composition with only a bit of sky really helps in that respect, I think.  Nice choice of a very lush green setting, too.  I was thinking maybe you could crop a bit off the left, but when I tried that, I didn''t like it as well.  It seems nicely balanced as is.  Another 6+, another good placing.  Even if you did steal the wife''s shot and she beat you anyway.  :-)', '2006-06-19 22:55:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530352, 346453, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  You went for the straight shadow, as did I, but at least you didn''t get hammered as bad for it. I have to admit that I gave you a 5 in voting as it just didn''t feel interesting. It was obvious that it was a young girl, but other than that, just a shadow. So, we both learned something with this one. Don''t do it again, LOL!</td>', 'Trading post...  You went for the straight shadow, as did I, but at least you didn''t get hammered as bad for it. I have to admit that I gave you a 5 in voting as it just didn''t feel interesting. It was obvious that it was a young girl, but other than that, just a shadow. So, we both learned something with this one. Don''t do it again, LOL!', '2006-06-19 23:07:03.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2530361, 345387, 10848, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your blue! Wonderful image.</td>', 'Congratulations on your blue! Wonderful image.', '2006-06-19 23:10:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530363, 345484, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  Very nice capture. I gave this a 7 in voting. Obviously it has shadows, but I didn''t think it really was about the shadows though. The light rays seem to be what the picture was about. I don''t see any real room for improvement, if this was a different challenge it would have gotten a much higher vote from me.</td>', 'Trading post...  Very nice capture. I gave this a 7 in voting. Obviously it has shadows, but I didn''t think it really was about the shadows though. The light rays seem to be what the picture was about. I don''t see any real room for improvement, if this was a different challenge it would have gotten a much higher vote from me.', '2006-06-19 23:11:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530365, 345927, 10848, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon. Outstanding shot!</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon. Outstanding shot!', '2006-06-19 23:12:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530376, 346474, 10848, '<td valign="top">Very creative.I knew this was a winner. Congratulations on your ribbon!</td>', 'Very creative.I knew this was a winner. Congratulations on your ribbon!', '2006-06-19 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530380, 346343, 50641, '<td valign="top">Wow... hugely creative idea and brilliantly executed.  Had I voted, this would have been a top scorer, no doubt.</td>', 'Wow... hugely creative idea and brilliantly executed.  Had I voted, this would have been a top scorer, no doubt.', '2006-06-19 23:14:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530391, 346383, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  Very nice play of light and shadow. You seem to really excel at these types of shots. The colors add alot of interest along with the brightness of the stairs. I really love how the darkness at the bottom left matches up to the darkness at the top right, really great symetry (spelling?). We''ll have to start calling you the goddess of shadows, LOL!</td>', 'Trading post...  Very nice play of light and shadow. You seem to really excel at these types of shots. The colors add alot of interest along with the brightness of the stairs. I really love how the darkness at the bottom left matches up to the darkness at the top right, really great symetry (spelling?). We''ll have to start calling you the goddess of shadows, LOL!', '2006-06-19 23:17:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530423, 344917, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  Great job here! After being DQ''d for a filter I''m really leary of using them anymore. This was so creative. IMHO, I think this should have scored higher. And I don''t think it looks processed.</td>', 'Trading post...  Great job here! After being DQ''d for a filter I''m really leary of using them anymore. This was so creative. IMHO, I think this should have scored higher. And I don''t think it looks processed.', '2006-06-19 23:26:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530537, 345927, 55506, '<td valign="top">This is indeed an interesting shot. No doubt. Congratulations for the ribbon</td>', 'This is indeed an interesting shot. No doubt. Congratulations for the ribbon', '2006-06-20 00:31:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530586, 345927, 12253, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  This is really outstanding.  I love the way you cropped it, and it was a super catch!</td>', 'Congratulations!  This is really outstanding.  I love the way you cropped it, and it was a super catch!', '2006-06-20 00:40:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530880, 345927, 26130, '<td valign="top">As a inveterate shadow and reflections seeker, I applaud your masterpiece. Luck helps but you still have to take the picture.</td>', 'As a inveterate shadow and reflections seeker, I applaud your masterpiece. Luck helps but you still have to take the picture.', '2006-06-20 02:37:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530885, 346474, 57358, '<td valign="top">awesome photo!  congrats on a well deserved ribbon</td>', 'awesome photo!  congrats on a well deserved ribbon', '2006-06-20 02:40:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530948, 345387, 60566, '<td valign="top">Wow Beautiful!</td>', 'Wow Beautiful!', '2006-06-20 03:20:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530976, 346477, 27133, '<td valign="top">Congrats on fourth place.</td>', 'Congrats on fourth place.', '2006-06-20 03:31:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2530980, 345927, 31889, '<td valign="top">Well done Sam!<br/> <br/>Congrats on your long overdue first ribbon.</td>', 'Well done Sam! Congrats on your long overdue first ribbon.', '2006-06-20 03:33:55.000000', NULL, 0),
