(2531479, 345756, 48228, '<td valign="top">I was so impressed with this one and think you have done an excellent job.....You scored well, and I think you had a great concept that worked.....</td>', 'I was so impressed with this one and think you have done an excellent job.....You scored well, and I think you had a great concept that worked.....', '2006-06-20 10:19:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2531753, 345387, 60244, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Colors, contrast, you did great.</td>', 'Wonderful! Colors, contrast, you did great.', '2006-06-20 12:21:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2531869, 345927, 60244, '<td valign="top">You got it!!!  Congrats1</td>', 'You got it!!!  Congrats1', '2006-06-20 13:04:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2531876, 346474, 60244, '<td valign="top">Your photo was one of the creative. You deserve the blue!</td>', 'Your photo was one of the creative. You deserve the blue!', '2006-06-20 13:07:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2531880, 346360, 49326, '<td valign="top">I love the DOF. Could you take a headshot with your lens at f/1.2?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-20 12:08:47.</i></td>', 'I love the DOF. Could you take a headshot with your lens at f/1.2?', '2006-06-20 13:08:25.000000', '2006-06-20 13:08:47.000000', 0),
(2531948, 345925, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: very good shot. What a week for you, two 6+ shots in a few days...<br/><b>Composition</b>: really dynamic, with the candle on the side and the nice effect of the shadows<br/><b>Subject</b>: perfect for the challenge, you selected a great subject, quite interesting<br/><b>Technical</b>: very good technichs here, good focus, wonderful light, nice tonality<br/><b>Improvement</b>: sorry for been a bit finicky, but there is a flare effect caused by the candle (I think that''s flare, I mean like a ray from the light to the left of the shot.<br/><b>Summary</b>: astounding work this week, keep improving<br/> <br/>Álex<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-22 04:23:05.</i></td>', 'Hello from Álex, CTP MkII   First Impression: very good shot. What a week for you, two 6+ shots in a few days...Composition: really dynamic, with the candle on the side and the nice effect of the shadowsSubject: perfect for the challenge, you selected a great subject, quite interestingTechnical: very good technichs here, good focus, wonderful light, nice tonalityImprovement: sorry for been a bit finicky, but there is a flare effect caused by the candle (I think that''s flare, I mean like a ray from the light to the left of the shot.Summary: astounding work this week, keep improving Álex', '2006-06-20 13:42:37.000000', '2006-06-22 05:23:05.000000', 0),
(2531966, 345925, 40465, '<td valign="top">Hi!<br/>The comp is good and the shaddows fill the rest of the ''open'' spce in the frame!  It is very pretty!:0)</td>', 'Hi!The comp is good and the shaddows fill the rest of the ''open'' spce in the frame!  It is very pretty!:0)', '2006-06-20 13:50:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2531970, 346496, 7322, '<td valign="top">I think this should have placed higher than it did. It did not deserve so many 3''s or 4''s--that''s just ludicrous. I gave it a 7.</td>', 'I think this should have placed higher than it did. It did not deserve so many 3''s or 4''s--that''s just ludicrous. I gave it a 7.', '2006-06-20 13:53:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2531979, 345116, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: Good idea to ask the kids play with the shadows, and very funny<br/><b>Composition</b>: I agree with you, it''s better with the kids on it.<br/><b>Subject</b>: Very good<br/><b>Technical</b>: the colors are not as bright as I would like to (maybe the light was too harsh). And seem you had a problem with the jpeg conversion, because I see some artifacts (on the face of her, i.e.)<br/><b>Improvement</b>: jpeg conversion, light.<br/><b>Summary</b>: Good shot, very consistent scores this week...<br/> <br/>Álex<br/></td>', 'Hello from Álex, CTP MkII   First Impression: Good idea to ask the kids play with the shadows, and very funnyComposition: I agree with you, it''s better with the kids on it.Subject: Very goodTechnical: the colors are not as bright as I would like to (maybe the light was too harsh). And seem you had a problem with the jpeg conversion, because I see some artifacts (on the face of her, i.e.)Improvement: jpeg conversion, light.Summary: Good shot, very consistent scores this week... Álex', '2006-06-20 13:56:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2532050, 346496, 57839, '<td valign="top">This is great work.  :)</td>', 'This is great work.  :)', '2006-06-20 14:21:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2532405, 344459, 22301, '<td valign="top">This was my pic for spoiling my shot at a ribbon in this challenge. Your shots are great at story telling and showing little slices of life, you are on my highest rated photographers list and one with one with the most challenge entries I have voted on which to me shows your constant excellence in challenges. Your one of the photographers I can pick out your shots out of masses on a consistent basis. Glad to have you here on DPC to enjoy your photos.</td>', 'This was my pic for spoiling my shot at a ribbon in this challenge. Your shots are great at story telling and showing little slices of life, you are on my highest rated photographers list and one with one with the most challenge entries I have voted on which to me shows your constant excellence in challenges. Your one of the photographers I can pick out your shots out of masses on a consistent basis. Glad to have you here on DPC to enjoy your photos.', '2006-06-20 16:47:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2532693, 345880, 33068, '<td valign="top">I must go back to Arches now after seeing this shot.  Very well done!</td>', 'I must go back to Arches now after seeing this shot.  Very well done!', '2006-06-20 19:15:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2533816, 345927, 29339, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I can''t stop laughing!<br/> <br/>I hope no shadow puppets were injured in the making of this photograph!<br/> <br/>Great job!  Congrats!</td>', 'LOL!  I can''t stop laughing! I hope no shadow puppets were injured in the making of this photograph! Great job!  Congrats!', '2006-06-21 01:15:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2534108, 346474, 47227, '<td valign="top">I love this!!!<br/>Great idea!</td>', 'I love this!!!Great idea!', '2006-06-21 01:38:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2534393, 345116, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hi Margie!<br/> <br/>What a couple of cuties! I love the way your daughter''s pigtails are caught mid-bounce. <br/> <br/>You did well capturing a shadow and really making it a main element in the photo. A lot of the other entries included a shadow but weren''t <i>about</i> the shadow, and you''ve avoided that particular pitfall of the theme. I do think the light here is a bit harsh, and it should use some sharpening. I think a polarizer might help tone down the brightness, since I know the kids probably don''t play like that at sunrise when the light is all golden and pretty.</td>', 'Hi Margie! What a couple of cuties! I love the way your daughter''s pigtails are caught mid-bounce.  You did well capturing a shadow and really making it a main element in the photo. A lot of the other entries included a shadow but weren''t about the shadow, and you''ve avoided that particular pitfall of the theme. I do think the light here is a bit harsh, and it should use some sharpening. I think a polarizer might help tone down the brightness, since I know the kids probably don''t play like that at sunrise when the light is all golden and pretty.', '2006-06-21 02:07:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2536490, 345387, 16241, '<td valign="top">great photo, congratulations!</td>', 'great photo, congratulations!', '2006-06-21 12:49:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2536928, 346497, 45790, '<td valign="top">You need a sharper (less diffused) light source to improve the edge sharpness of the shadows. As it is, it looks blurred.</td>', 'You need a sharper (less diffused) light source to improve the edge sharpness of the shadows. As it is, it looks blurred.', '2006-06-21 14:45:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2538523, 345756, 37893, '<td valign="top">The lighting is great for this image. The tilt gives it a dynamic feel that would have been lost had it been straight. My only suggestion is regarding the crop. It''s a bit too tight on the left hand side.</td>', 'The lighting is great for this image. The tilt gives it a dynamic feel that would have been lost had it been straight. My only suggestion is regarding the crop. It''s a bit too tight on the left hand side.', '2006-06-21 21:44:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2538725, 345927, 46651, '<td valign="top">This is such a great shot! Great candid capture!</td>', 'This is such a great shot! Great candid capture!', '2006-06-21 22:30:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2538900, 346034, 47933, '<td valign="top">Very cool Shez! I really like the tone of the image. This really looks like it was taken with a special film. Great job!!</td>', 'Very cool Shez! I really like the tone of the image. This really looks like it was taken with a special film. Great job!!', '2006-06-21 23:20:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2539284, 345927, 5885, '<td valign="top">I''m still trying to figure out why Nobody won the red ribbon this week. hmmm...<br/> <br/>Great shot Sam. Congrats on the ribbon. Well deserved.</td>', 'I''m still trying to figure out why Nobody won the red ribbon this week. hmmm... Great shot Sam. Congrats on the ribbon. Well deserved.', '2006-06-22 00:21:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2539561, 346153, 60861, '<td valign="top">love it...</td>', 'love it...', '2006-06-22 01:39:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2539718, 345726, 46882, '<td valign="top">Classic shot!</td>', 'Classic shot!', '2006-06-22 02:40:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2540477, 346250, 16241, '<td valign="top">subtle, beautiful, should have scored much much higher</td>', 'subtle, beautiful, should have scored much much higher', '2006-06-22 10:19:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2540806, 346166, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey!  I''ve seen this guy somewhere else before...  ;^)  No, really!  Now I''ll have to find it - a very similar shot.  Nonetheless, I like this.  Looks like the voters did also.  You did a nice job in laying out the composition, using the dark area lower right to create a ROT type comp.</td>', 'Hey!  I''ve seen this guy somewhere else before...  ;^)  No, really!  Now I''ll have to find it - a very similar shot.  Nonetheless, I like this.  Looks like the voters did also.  You did a nice job in laying out the composition, using the dark area lower right to create a ROT type comp.', '2006-06-22 12:10:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2541092, 346284, 32321, '<td valign="top">Hi! Heres a comment from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>First Impression:<br/>Nice blue! My eye is drawn to the lock, the bolt, the black vertical line, then the shadows<br/> <br/>Composition:<br/>I like the fact that the lock and bolt are not centered. The lighting really works well with the blue and the paint texture.<br/> <br/>Subject:<br/>Meets challenge, but the shadow was not the main point of interest.<br/> <br/>Technical:<br/>Despite what others said, I find it a bit grainy. Given the light Im surprised you used ISO800. You didnt include any post processing comments so Im not sure what you did, if anything.<br/> <br/>Summary:<br/>The blue and composition really carried the shot. Congratulations on your 71% placement. Supports your goal!<br/></td>', 'Hi! Heres a comment from the Critique Club. First Impression:Nice blue! My eye is drawn to the lock, the bolt, the black vertical line, then the shadows Composition:I like the fact that the lock and bolt are not centered. The lighting really works well with the blue and the paint texture. Subject:Meets challenge, but the shadow was not the main point of interest. Technical:Despite what others said, I find it a bit grainy. Given the light Im surprised you used ISO800. You didnt include any post processing comments so Im not sure what you did, if anything. Summary:The blue and composition really carried the shot. Congratulations on your 71% placement. Supports your goal!', '2006-06-22 13:47:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2541094, 346383, 2490, '<td valign="top">==Trading Post==<br/> <br/>Hey, I really liked this one - gave it an 8.  I don''t exactly know why, but the pattern combined with the colors made it appealing to me.  Good job.</td>', '==Trading Post== Hey, I really liked this one - gave it an 8.  I don''t exactly know why, but the pattern combined with the colors made it appealing to me.  Good job.', '2006-06-22 13:48:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2542170, 346474, 58938, '<td valign="top">awesome picture.</td>', 'awesome picture.', '2006-06-22 18:59:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2542248, 345927, 32802, '<td valign="top">Love the picture. And that show... I have a similiar picture... wonder if it is the same guy?<br/> <br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio_edit.php?IMAGE_ID=351738<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-22 18:30:50.</i></td>', 'Love the picture. And that show... I have a similiar picture... wonder if it is the same guy? //www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio_edit.php?IMAGE_ID=351738', '2006-06-22 19:30:09.000000', '2006-06-22 19:30:50.000000', 0),
(2542533, 346254, 23203, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the critique club<br/> <br/>I like the complementary colors in the subject, and the composition. It would have done better in any other challenge - but this one was more about the shadow, and getting creative with it.<br/> <br/>I see you''ve taken this at a low ISO setting, but still the shadow appears a bit noisy - i wonder if it was caused by sharpening.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps. Good luck!</td>', 'Greetings from the critique club I like the complementary colors in the subject, and the composition. It would have done better in any other challenge - but this one was more about the shadow, and getting creative with it. I see you''ve taken this at a low ISO setting, but still the shadow appears a bit noisy - i wonder if it was caused by sharpening. Hope this helps. Good luck!', '2006-06-22 20:53:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2542809, 345680, 23203, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the critique club.<br/> <br/>I like the composition and colors, and the creative use of shadow.<br/>Should''ve scored better, if you ask me.<br/> <br/>The only thing I would change is the crop, to make it more square.</td>', 'Greetings from the critique club. I like the composition and colors, and the creative use of shadow.Should''ve scored better, if you ask me. The only thing I would change is the crop, to make it more square.', '2006-06-22 22:05:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2542817, 346166, 37893, '<td valign="top">This was one of my faves during the challenge. Instead of green, I''m seeing blue! What a departure from the expected. The little guy''s silhouette, eventhough we''ve seen a dozen times, never seems to get old ;) Great find Jimmy!</td>', 'This was one of my faves during the challenge. Instead of green, I''m seeing blue! What a departure from the expected. The little guy''s silhouette, eventhough we''ve seen a dozen times, never seems to get old ;) Great find Jimmy!', '2006-06-22 22:08:04.000000', NULL, 0),
